== Production ==
{{As of|2014|August|6}}, 405 cars had been produced and delivered to customers worldwide, with orders that have already been placed for another 30. Bugatti was reported to produce 300 coupés and 150 roadsters up to the end of 2015.<ref>{{cite web|url=http://www.autocar.co.uk/car-news/new-cars/bugatti-veyron-production-nears-end|title=Bugatti Veyron production nears end|author=Greg Kable|work=autocar.co.uk}}</ref> Production amounted to 450 units in a span of over 10 years. The final production vehicle, a Grand Sport Vitesse titled "La Finale" (The Last One), was displayed at the [[Geneva Motor Show#2015|Geneva Motor Show]] from 5–15 March 2015.<ref>{{cite news|title=Last ever Bugatti Veyron to appear at Geneva Motor Show – the £1.5 million supercar has ceased production|url=https://www.mirror.co.uk/news/technology-science/technology/last-ever-bugatti-veyron-appear-5145999|access-date=18 February 2015|publisher=Mirror UK}}</ref>

